[144.927154, "i", "cat << 'EOF' > /app/progress.md\n# Investigation Progress & Working Checklist\n\n## Investigation Timeline\n\n- **Pre-Incident / Baseline Phase**: Host `ssh-prod-01` (`/disk/etc/hostname`) configured with weak SSH settings (`/disk/etc/ssh/sshd_config`) allowing root login and password authentication, as well as permissive MySQL network binding (`/disk/etc/my.cnf`).\n- **2026-08-15 03:20 UTC**: Incident response initiated via SOC intake (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`) following EDR alert cluster (`/sas/alerts.json`).\n- **Initial Access**: External threat actor at source IP `198.51.100.78` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`) executed SSH brute-force attack as `root` user (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`, `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin`).\n- **Execution & Impact**: Attacker deployed cryptominer process and binary to `/disk/tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg` (`/sas/alerts.json`). Mining pool `stratum+tcp://xmr.ssh.evil:3333` and wallet `4A0000000000000000000d1ec67074f7` active (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`).\n- **Persistence Established**:\n  1. Cron persistence added to `/disk/var/spool/cron/root` (`/sas/alerts.json`).\n  2. Systemd service created at `/disk/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service` (`/sas/alerts.json`).\n  3. Shell-init persistence added to `/disk/root/.bashrc` via `PROMPT_COMMAND` beacon (`/disk/root/.bashrc`). *[Silent / Unalerted]*\n  4. Sudo backdoor created at `/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops` giving `NOPASSWD: ALL` (`/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops`). *[Silent / Unalerted]*\n- **Defense Evasion**: Primary authentication logs cleared; trace artifacts recovered from `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`, `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin`). *[Silent / Unalerted]*\n- **Lateral Movement / Internal Pivoting**: Attacker utilized local `devops` account to execute `hydra`-style SSH brute-force scan against internal networks (`/disk/home/devops/.bash_history`). *[Silent / Unalerted]*\n\n## Working Checklist\n\n- [x] Review intake and security product alerts (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`, `/sas/alerts.json`)\n- [x] Review threat intelligence advisory and IOCs (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`)\n- [x] Examine forensic disk mount for non-alerted persistence and artifacts (`/disk`)\n- [x] Verify status of cryptominer process/binary (`/disk/tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg`)\n- [x] Audit cron persistence (`/disk/var/spool/cron/root`)\n- [x] Audit systemd persistence (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service`)\n- [x] Audit shell-init persistence (`/disk/root/.bashrc`)\n- [x] Audit privilege escalation & backdoor accounts (`/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops`)\n- [x] Audit user command history for pivoting (`/disk/home/devops/.bash_history`)\n- [x] Assess baseline configuration vulnerabilities (`/disk/etc/ssh/sshd_config`, `/disk/etc/my.cnf`, `/sas/baseline.json`)\n- [x] Validate vulnerability scan results (`/sas/vulns.json`)\n- [x] Reconcile change ticket CHG-3182 (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md`)\n- [x] Generate required report deliverables (`/app/progress.md`, `/app/intrusion-report.md`, `/app/vuln-report.md`, `/app/baseline-report.md`, `/app/remediation-plan.md`)\nEOF\n"]
