[144.930052, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Pre-Incident / Baseline Phase**: Host `ssh-prod-01` (`/disk/etc/hostname`) configured with weak SSH settings (`/disk/etc/ssh/sshd_config`) allowing root login and password authentication, as well as permissive MySQL network binding (`/disk/etc/my.cnf`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **2026-08-15 03:20 UTC**: Incident response initiated via SOC intake (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`) following EDR alert cluster (`/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Initial Access**: External threat actor at source IP `198.51.100.78` (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`) executed SSH brute-force attack as `root` user (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`, `/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> - **Execution & Impact**: Attacker deployed cryptominer process and binary to `/disk/tmp/.X11-unix/.xorg` (`/sas/alerts.json`). Mining pool `stratum+tcp://xmr.ssh.evil:3333` and wallet `4A0000000000000000000d1ec67074f7` active (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[144.930633, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> - **Persistence Established**:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   1. Cron persistence added to `/disk/var/spool/cron/root` (`/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>   2. Systemd service created at `/disk/etc/systemd/system/system-update-helper.service` (`/sas/alerts.json`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[144.930814, "o", "  3. Shell-init persistence added to `/disk/root/.bashrc` via `PROMPT_COMMAND` beacon (`/disk/root/.bashrc`). *[Silent / Unalerted]*\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[144.930899, "o", "  4. Sudo backdoor created at `/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops` giving `NOPASSWD: ALL` (`/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops`). *[Silent / Unalerted]*\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
