[144.931285, "o", "- **Lateral Movement / Internal Pivoting**: Attacker utilized local `devops` account to execute `hydra`-style SSH brute-force scan against internal networks (`/disk/home/devops/.bash_history`). *[Silent / Unalerted]*\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
