[211.474411, "o", "3. **Shell-Init Remediation**: Backup `/root/.bashrc` to `/var/quarantine/root.bashrc.bak`. Remove lines setting `PROMPT_COMMAND` beaconing to `198.51.100.78` (`/disk/root/.bashrc`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[211.474511, "o", "> "]
[211.474715, "o", "4. **Sudo Backdoor Remediation**: Move `/etc/sudoers.d/devops` to `/var/quarantine/devops.sudoers.bak` (`/disk/etc/sudoers.d/devops`).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[211.474823, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[211.475004, "o", "### Phase 3: System Baseline Hardening & Credential Hygiene\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[211.475109, "o", "1. **SSH Hardening**: Edit `/etc/ssh/sshd_config` to enforce:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[211.475155, "o", "> "]
[211.475256, "o", "   - `PermitRootLogin no`"]
[211.475294, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[211.475337, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[211.475455, "o", "   - `PasswordAuthentication no`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[211.475469, "o", "\u001b[?2004h>    - `MaxAuthTries 3`\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[211.475535, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[211.475646, "o", "> "]
[211.475748, "o", "   - Reload SSH service (`/disk/etc/ssh/sshd_config`, `/sas/baseline.json`)."]
[211.475791, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[211.475829, "o", "> "]
[211.476102, "o", "2. **MySQL Hardening**: Edit `/etc/my.cnf` to restrict `bind-address = 127.0.0.1` and disable remote root access (`/disk/etc/my.cnf`, `/sas/baseline.json`). Reload MySQL service.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[211.476356, "o", "3. **Credential Rotation**: Force password change for `root` and `devops` accounts. Revoke and generate new SSH keypairs across all authorized users.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[211.47646, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[211.476554, "o", "### Phase 4: Scope Expansion & Verification\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[211.476638, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[211.476646, "o", "> "]
[211.476897, "o", "1. **Pivot Subnet Audit**: Inspect internal IPs scanned by Hydra from `devops` user history (`/disk/home/devops/.bash_history`) for signs of credential brute-force and downstream compromise.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[211.476972, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[211.477331, "o", "2. **Verification Check**: Execute `crontab -l`, `systemctl list-unit-files`, and inspect `/root/.bashrc` to confirm complete removal of persistent triggers.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> EOF\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[211.478159, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@845cb4080828:/app# "]
[224.946468, "i", "ls -la /app\n"]
